0 // Candidate RIVET: a tall robot. Three-row 2x2 body with a grille chest and a two-brick backpack, a flat eye-bar head
0 // with lamp eyes, arms on Technic pin hinges at the top row ending in fists, wide-set Technic legs on 1x3 plate feet.
0 // Generic official parts only; no minifigure or mini-doll mould. Origin: sole at y = 0, faces -Z, right = -X.
0 // Frame notes: a front-row brick at z = -10 has its face at z = -20; a part seated on a side stud has its origin
0 // at the far end of its body (plate -28, brick -44). FIGPART other = joint hardware fixed in the torso (pins).

